      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": "## Best Practices"
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": "1. **Use Material Theme**: Access colors via `MaterialTheme.colorScheme` for automatic dark mode support"
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "2. **Support Dynamic Color**: Enable dynamic color on Android 12+ for personalization"
      },
      {
        "line": 87,
        "text": "3. **Adaptive Layouts**: Use `WindowSizeClass` for responsive designs"
      },
      {
        "line": 88,
        "text": "4. **Content Descriptions**: Add `contentDescription` to all interactive elements"
      },
      {
        "line": 89,
        "text": "5. **Touch Targets**: Minimum 48dp touch targets for accessibility"
      },
      {
        "line": 90,
        "text": "6. **State Hoisting**: Hoist state to make components reusable and testable"
      },
      {
        "line": 91,
        "text": "7. **Remember Properly**: Use `remember` and `rememberSaveable` appropriately"
      },
      {
        "line": 92,
        "text": "8. **Preview Annotations**: Add `@Preview` with different configurations"
      },
      {
        "line": 93,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 94,
        "text": "## Common Issues"
      },
      {
        "line": 95,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 96,
        "text": "- **Recomposition Issues**: Avoid passing unstable lambdas; use `remember`"
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": "- **State Loss**: Use `rememberSaveable` for configuration changes"
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": "- **Performance**: Use `LazyColumn` instead of `Column` for long lists"
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": "- **Theme Leaks**: Ensure `MaterialTheme` wraps all composables"
      },
      {
        "line": 100,
